      "content": "i hear you. but like, i actually have some leftover nitroglycerin from a few years ago when my uncle had heart stuff. and i have some extra ibuprofen too. would it be okay if i just took a couple of those now to see if it settles the pain? if it works i'll just sleep it off.",
